<%# locals: (toast: Current.user.present?) %>
<%# The flash (rune_ui's flash): a notice goes by itself after a few seconds,
    an alert stays until it's dismissed. Signed in, it floats as toasts in the
    bottom right, so a message never pushes the screen down; the sign-in pages
    keep it in the page, beside the form it's about. In a frame, so a Turbo
    Stream can replace it ("flash"). %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag :flash do %>
  <%= flash_messages(toast:) %>
<% end %>
